  "description": "Year 2832. A future where Earth has been destroyed by nuclear war. \nIn a research group searching for humanity's new home, Chae-on, who had been living as an outcast, is dispatched alone to \"Undeveloped Planet 99\" like a discarded card.\n\nWhat he discovers there is a signal of new life. \nThe joy of finding humanity's hope is short-lived, as unidentified alien creatures attack Chae-on.\n\nBut these guys... why do they keep poking only at the spots that feel good?! \nChae-on, driven to the brink of dying from overstimulation by their merciless and forceful search. \nAt that moment, a mysterious boy appears before him.\n\n\n---\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/PLANET_99)",
